        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 2:47PM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...E wind 35 kt. Seas 9 ft.
.SAT...E wind 30 kt. Seas 7 ft. Rain.
.SAT NIGHT...E wind 30 kt. Seas 7 ft. Widespread rain showers.
.SUN...E wind 20 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...E wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.MON...NE wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.TUE...E wind 10 kt. Seas 2 ft.
.WED...E wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
</description>
